e_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "output_not_broadcasting": {"OPT_CONNECTION": true, "onExecuted": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {"onTrigger": true}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "secondTabOffset": 80, "sort": "position", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "toggleRestriction": "default", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "showAllGraphs": true, "enableTabs": false, "ue_convert": true, "matchTitle": "Seed", "showNav": true, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [444.4012756347656, 795.5498046875], "pos": [450, -290], "widgets_values": ["我将分析这张布查特花园（Butchart Gardens）风格的经典园林图像，并为您生成四个季节的2X2分格提示词。\n\n---\n\n## 原始图像分析\n\n**场景特征**：英式下沉花园风格，蜿蜒石板步道，对称锥形柏树，多层花坛（红色/粉色/黄色/白色花卉），修剪整齐的绿篱，背景岩壁与茂密林冠，三位游客点缀尺度感，柔和漫射自然光。\n\n---\n\n## 四季变换 2×2 网格提示词\n\n```\nA professional 2x2 grid composite of the same formal garden scene across four seasons, photorealistic architectural photography style, identical composition and camera angle maintained in all quadrants:\n\n[Top-Left: SPRING] Fresh lime-green new growth on all deciduous trees and shrubs, cherry blossoms and tulips in pink/white/coral replacing summer annuals, soft diffused morning light with gentle sun rays, dewdrops on grass blades, flowering bulbs emerging in borders, pastel color palette, airy atmosphere --ar 1:1\n\n[Top-Right: SUMMER] Lush dense emerald green foliage at peak maturity, vibrant saturated flower beds in crimson magenta butter-yellow and pure white identical to original layout, strong warm golden afternoon sunlight casting defined shadows, deep blue sky visible through canopy, rich verdant tones, high contrast --ar 1:1\n\n[Bottom-Left: AUTUMN] Japanese maples and deciduous specimens in brilliant scarlet burnt-orange and golden yellow, copper beech retaining deep purple-brown, fallen leaves scattered on stone pathway, clear crisp amber-toned light with long shadows, asters and chrysanthemums in autumn hues, harvest atmosphere --ar 1:1\n\n[Bottom-Right: WINTER] Bare branching structure of deciduous trees revealed, yews and conical cypress maintaining deep evergreen, light dusting of snow on path edges and shrub tops, frost patterns on remaining foliage, cool blue-grey overcast diffused light, subtle mist in background, dormant perennials with seed heads, quiet serene mood --ar 1:1\n\nTechnical specifications: shot from identical elevated viewpoint, 35mm equivalent lens perspective, stone pathway curvature preserved, two tall central cypress anchors unchanged position, rocky cliff backdrop constant, visitors removed for seasonal purity, seamless quadrant borders, museum-quality botanical documentation, 8K ultra-detailed --style raw --q 2\n```\n\n---\n\n## 关键控制要素说明\n\n| 固定元素 | 季节变量 |\n|---------|---------|\n| 双锥形柏树位置形态 | 叶色密度/针叶色泽 |\n| 蜿蜒石板步道曲线 | 表面状态（落叶/积雪/干燥） |\n| 分层花坛几何布局 | 花卉物种与色彩周期 |\n| 背景岩壁与林冠轮廓 | 透光率与大气透视 |\n| 摄影机位与透视关系 | 光线角度与色温 |\n\n如需调整特定季节强度（如冬季增加积雪厚度）或添加人物活动元素，可进一步优化。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 313, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 170, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "e900c2ca9c0d90b0896881910ca7f3f02d88ebd8", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["👉[魔塔注册地址](https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/accounts/registration) 👈点击跳转\n\n------------------\n\n👉[模型选择](https://www.modelscope.cn/models?page=1&tabKey=task&tasks=image-captioning&type=multi-modal) 👈点击跳转\n\n------------------\n\n👉[API控制台](https://www.modelscope.cn/my/access/token) 👈点击跳转\n\n---------------